# EtWizard Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtWizard` is a multi-step guided flow layout component. It manages step progression with an animated segmented progress bar (integrated in the topbar), optional left/right tap zones, and auto-play support.

Behavior is configured via boolean props:

- **`tapGestures`** - Enables left/right tap zones for step navigation and press-to-pause
- **`autoPlay`** - Enables automatic timed progression through steps

**Does NOT handle:**

- Content rendering (you provide step content)
- Screen presentation (use Expo Router Stack with `presentation: 'fullScreenModal'`)

## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtWizard` (main component)

```tsx
<EtWizard
  stepDuration?: number           // default 5000ms
  autoPlay?: boolean              // default: false
  tapGestures?: boolean           // default: false
  initialStep?: number            // default: 0
  onStepChange?: (step: number) => void
  onComplete?: () => void
  progressColor?: string          // override progress bar fill color
  accessibilityLabelLeft?: string  // a11y label for left tap zone (used when tapGestures is true)
  accessibilityLabelRight?: string // a11y label for right tap zone (used when tapGestures is true)
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  <EtWizard.TopbarStart>{/* back button */}</EtWizard.TopbarStart>
  <EtWizard.TopbarMiddle>{/* title */}</EtWizard.TopbarMiddle>
  <EtWizard.TopbarEnd>{/* close / menu */}</EtWizard.TopbarEnd>

  {/* Footer is declared inside each Step */}
  <EtWizard.Step>
    {/* step 0 content */}
    <EtWizard.Footer>{/* step 0 actions */}</EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>

  <EtWizard.Step>
    {/* step 1 content */}
    <EtWizard.Footer>{/* step 1 actions */}</EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>
</EtWizard>
```

### `EtWizard.TopbarStart`

