### `EtWizard.Step`

```tsx
<EtWizard.Step
  backgroundImage?: ImageSourcePropType   // full-bleed background image
  backgroundVideo?: string                // video URL, plays once silently
  stepDuration?: number                   // override per-step duration
  contentPosition?: 'top' | 'bottom'     // vertical alignment (default: 'top')
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {ReactNode}
  <EtWizard.Footer>{/* optional footer for this step */}</EtWizard.Footer>
</EtWizard.Step>
```

