### `EtWizard.Button`

```tsx
<EtWizard.Button
  variant?: ButtonVariant            // default: 'primary-filled'
  size?: ButtonSize                  // default: 'large'
  stretch?: boolean                  // default: true
  disabled?: boolean
  loading?: boolean
  onPress?: () => void               // default: goToNext from wizard context
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {/* Compose with subcomponents or pass a string */}
  <EtWizard.Button.Icon name="star" />
  <EtWizard.Button.Label>Next</EtWizard.Button.Label>
</EtWizard.Button>
```

Compositional CTA button for wizard footers. Thin wrapper around `EtButton` with wizard defaults. Defaults `onPress` to `goToNext` from wizard context when not provided. Icon position is controlled by child order. Subcomponents `EtWizard.Button.Label` and `EtWizard.Button.Icon` are re-exports of `EtButton.Label` and `EtButton.Icon`.

### `EtWizard.Icon`

```tsx
<EtWizard.Icon
  name: string                       // icon name from Zappicons library
  variant?: IconVariant              // default: 'regular'
  size?: IconSize | number           // default: 24
  color?: string                     // override icon color
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
/>
```

Standalone icon wrapping `EtIconV2`. Useful for decorative icons inside step content.

### `EtWizard.Footer`

```tsx
<EtWizard.Footer
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {ReactNode}   // typically an EtWizard.Button
</EtWizard.Footer>
```

Declare inside an `EtWizard.Step` to attach a footer to that step. The wizard extracts the footer and renders it in a fixed area below the step content. Steps without a Footer have no footer area.

## Behavior

### Progress Bar

- Divided into N segments (one per Step child)
- Completed steps are fully filled
- Current step animates from 0 to 100% over `stepDuration` ms (when autoPlay is true)
- Future steps show only background (8% opacity)
- 2px gap between segments, each 4px tall with 16px border radius

### Navigation

- **Tap zones** (when `tapGestures` is true): Left half goes to previous step, right half goes to next step
- **Button navigation**: No animation, immediately jumps to next/previous step
- **Auto-advance** (when `autoPlay` is true): When a segment fills to 100%, auto-advances to next step
- **Pause/resume** (when `tapGestures` and `autoPlay` are both true): Press-in pauses auto-play and background video, press-out resumes both

### Full-Screen Backgrounds

- `backgroundImage` and `backgroundVideo` declared on `EtWizard.Step` are rendered at the **wizard root level** (absolutely positioned behind topbar, content, and footer) so they fill the entire screen edge-to-edge.
- When a step has a background, the topbar automatically becomes transparent.
- When `contentPosition="bottom"` is combined with a background, a gradient scrim (transparent to 75% black) is auto-applied to ensure text readability.

### Safe Area

- The topbar container applies `useSafeAreaInsets().top` as padding so the progress bar and icons sit below the device status bar/notch.

## Usage Patterns

### Basic wizard flow (string shorthand)

```tsx
<EtWizard onComplete={() => navigation.navigate('Home')}>
  <EtWizard.Step>
    <EtWizard.Title>Welcome to eToro</EtWizard.Title>
    <EtWizard.Subtitle>Start your trading journey</EtWizard.Subtitle>
    <EtWizard.Footer>
      <EtWizard.Button>Next</EtWizard.Button>
    </EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>
  <EtWizard.Step>
    <EtWizard.Title>Discover Markets</EtWizard.Title>
    <EtWizard.Footer>
      <EtWizard.Button>Next</EtWizard.Button>
    </EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>
</EtWizard>
```

### Per-step footers with button icon

```tsx
<EtWizard onComplete={() => navigation.navigate('Home')}>
  {/* Step 1 - icon left of label (child order controls position) */}
  <EtWizard.Step>
    <EtWizard.Title>Welcome to eToro</EtWizard.Title>
    <EtWizard.Subtitle>Start your trading journey</EtWizard.Subtitle>
    <EtWizard.Footer>
      <EtWizard.Button>
        <EtWizard.Button.Icon name="star" />
        <EtWizard.Button.Label>Next</EtWizard.Button.Label>
      </EtWizard.Button>
    </EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>

  {/* Step 2 - icon right of label */}
  <EtWizard.Step>
    <EtWizard.Title>You're all set</EtWizard.Title>
    <EtWizard.Footer>
      <EtWizard.Button onPress={handleClose}>
        <EtWizard.Button.Label>Close</EtWizard.Button.Label>
        <EtWizard.Button.Icon name="chevronRight" />
      </EtWizard.Button>
    </EtWizard.Footer>
  </EtWizard.Step>
</EtWizard>
```

