## Dependencies & Edges

### Internal Dependencies

- `EtTopbar` + `EtTopbar.StepProgress` - topbar with integrated progress bar
- `react-native-reanimated` - segment fill animation (withTiming, useSharedValue)
- `expo-linear-gradient` - gradient scrim for bottom-positioned content over backgrounds
- `expo-video` - background video playback (VideoView, useVideoPlayer)
- `react-native-safe-area-context` - topbar safe area insets

### Design System Integration

- Progress bar colors from theme (`textPrimaryNeutral` for light)
- Spacing uses tokens (`X1`, `X6`, `X10`)
- Topbar follows existing EtTopbar compound pattern

